pdn-lin - pdn-win for Linux: packet radio terminal with a built-in soundcard modem
https://github.com/packet-net/pdn-win

Copyright (c) 2026 Tom Fanning M0LTE and Packet.NET contributors

This package ships a self-contained build that bundles the pdn-win code, its
.NET dependencies (packet.net, pdn-soundmodem, Avalonia and the rest), the
.NET runtime, and the native libraries SkiaSharp and HarfBuzzSharp draw with.

